1
00:00:00,309 --> 00:00:03,309
(Leonard:)On account of how sad I am
about my mom.

2
00:00:09,485 --> 00:00:10,695
(Howard:)Leonard, you ready for lunch?

3
00:00:10,753 --> 00:00:11,893
One sec!

4
00:00:14,256 --> 00:00:15,326
(Leonard:)Hey. Sorry.

5
00:00:18,194 --> 00:00:20,234
(Howard:)-Hi, Penny.
-Hi.

6
00:00:20,329 --> 00:00:22,539
(Penny:)All right, sweetie.
You hang in there today.

7
00:00:22,598 --> 00:00:24,578
(Leonard:)I'll try, but I might be sad
again tonight.

8
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:25,577
(Penny:)Okay.

9
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:31,781
Wow! Sex at work?!

10
00:00:31,874 --> 00:00:33,914
(Leonard:)Leave it alone.
That's my girlfriend.

11
00:00:33,943 --> 00:00:36,443
(Penny:)-Sorry.
-Who just had sex with me at work!

12
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,960
(Howard:)Damn.
How'd you swing that?

13
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:42,392
(Leonard:)Whenever I talk about
how awful my mom was,

14
00:00:42,418 --> 00:00:44,398
(Leonard:)Penny will do anything
to make me feel better.

15
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,760
(Howard:)-Seriously?
-Look, I mean...

16
00:00:45,855 --> 00:00:48,925
(Leonard:)I'm not proud of it,
but it does work.

17
00:00:49,058 --> 00:00:53,198
(Leonard:)I got her to watch a six-part
documentary on Monty Python.

18
00:00:53,262 --> 00:00:57,372
(Leonard:)Even I was bored, I just wanted
to see if she'd make it to the end.

19
00:00:57,433 --> 00:00:59,643
(Howard:)You sound kind of proud of it.

